@title EMC design record: the Save buttons in the Light theme
@area Reports
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# Check > EMC check with the Light theme: the two Save EMC record buttons sit under the design-aid sentence.
open qa/fixtures/emc-cabinet-door.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text preferences
wait 8
key Enter
wait 10
click_text Light
wait 10
key Escape
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc check
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
expect "Save EMC record (PDF)"
expect "Save EMC record (Excel)"
shot 00-buttons
check_layout
